<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>404 - Страница не найдена</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --ink: #173b28;
      --ink-soft: #54705f;
      --green: #2f7045;
      --green-dark: #1f5533;
      --green-pale: #e9f6e9;
      --green-line: #c6dfc8;
      --paper: #fbfdf8;
      --accent: #8b3434;
      --shadow: rgba(27, 67, 43, .12);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      min-width: 300px;
      min-height: 100%;
      background: #eef7ec;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 14px/1.55 Verdana, Geneva, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #eef7ec;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(50, 112, 69, .035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(50, 112, 69, .035) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 32px 32px;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(100%, 680px);
    }

    .card {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 0 42px 36px;
      border: 1px solid var(--green-line);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--green);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(251, 253, 248, .96);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px var(--shadow), 0 2px 8px rgba(27, 67, 43, .06);
    }

    .card::after {
      position: absolute;
      right: -48px;
      bottom: -64px;
      width: 190px;
      height: 190px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(47, 112, 69, .08);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 26px rgba(47, 112, 69, .025),
        0 0 0 54px rgba(47, 112, 69, .018);
      content: "";
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .topbar {
      min-height: 56px;
      margin: 0 -42px 28px;
      padding: 0 42px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #dbeadb;
      background: var(--green-pale);
    }

    .brand {
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-size: 11px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .status::before {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #4a965c;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(74, 150, 92, .13);
      content: "";
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 2px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .11em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-size: clamp(76px, 19vw, 132px);
      line-height: .95;
      letter-spacing: -.075em;
      text-shadow: 0 4px 0 #d8ead8;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 22px 0 8px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(21px, 4vw, 28px);
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .description {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }

    .actions {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin-top: 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 42px;
      padding: 10px 17px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--green);
      border-radius: 3px;
      color: var(--green-dark);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #f8fcf6;
      transition: background-color .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, color .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
    }

    .button-primary {
      border-color: var(--green-dark);
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--green-dark);
      removed-box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #163f27;
    }

    .button:hover {
      border-color: var(--green-dark);
      background: var(--green-pale);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--green);
    }

    .button:active {
      transform: translateY(1px);
    }

    .button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid rgba(139, 52, 52, .25);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .arrow {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .hint {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin: 30px 0 0;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--green-line);
      color: #708476;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      body {
        padding: 14px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 0 22px 26px;
        border-radius: 10px;
      }

      .topbar {
        margin: 0 -22px 24px;
        padding: 0 22px;
      }

      .actions {
        display: grid;
      }

      .button {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .button {
        transition: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="error-title">
      <header class="topbar">
        <span class="brand">GWars.io</span>
        <span class="status">сервер доступен, но</span>
      </header>

      <p class="eyebrow">что-то пошло не так</p>
      <h1 aria-label="Ошибка 404">404</h1>
      <h2 id="error-title">Страница не найдена</h2>
      <p class="description">
        Похоже, такой страницы уже нет или адрес был указан неверно.
      </p>

      <nav class="actions" aria-label="Куда перейти">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="https://www.gwars.io/login.php">
          Войти в игру <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="button" href="https://www.gwars.io/me.php">
          Страница персонажа
        </a>
      </nav>

      <p class="hint">Ошибка 404 · запрошенный адрес не найден</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
